direction: right

Traffic: Incoming Traffic
Traffic -> Request Burst: 极短瞬时尖峰 (100ms)

Request Burst -> CPU Metric: 引发底层资源紧张
CPU Metric: {
  label: CPU Monitoring
  shape: cylinder
  style.stroke: "#f59e0b"
}
CPU Metric -> Controller Reaction: 延迟数秒才告警
Controller Reaction: {
  label: Lagging Feedback\n(Too late)
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  style.stroke-width: 3
}

Request Burst -> Quota Signal: 抵达请求入口
Quota Signal: {
  label: Quota Consumption
  shape: step
  style.stroke: "#16a34a"
}
Quota Signal -> Quick Control: 执行前立刻获取消耗
Quick Control: {
  label: Leading Signal\n(Immediate action)
  style.stroke: "#2563eb"
  style.stroke-width: 3
}
